==Battleground==
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 173.33 seconds<sup>5,200f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Dober is at a low enough magnification for it to not be a problem. If you're really worried, use Wave Immune Labyrinth fodder.

